WEBVTT

00:00:11.730 --> 00:00:13.400
Chronos is here!

00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:15.840
Shoot! Shoot them down!

00:00:20.740 --> 00:00:23.080
You've allowed the enemy to invade!?

00:00:23.080 --> 00:00:25.750
Hurry up and surround them!

00:00:25.750 --> 00:00:28.450
Aghh! Chrono Numbers!

00:00:29.750 --> 00:00:31.750
So you know about us...

00:00:31.750 --> 00:00:33.420
Arghh! Shoot! Shoot!

00:00:33.420 --> 00:00:34.950
Out of our way!

00:00:43.770 --> 00:00:46.440
Aghh! Run!!

00:00:46.440 --> 00:00:49.700
You cannot escape my arrows!

00:00:51.770 --> 00:00:55.780
Geez, what a flashy show
you all are putting on!

00:00:55.780 --> 00:00:58.940
Today's cards are sharper than usual.

00:01:12.730 --> 00:01:15.060
Apostles of the Stars...

00:01:15.060 --> 00:01:17.070
The power of Chronos...

00:01:17.070 --> 00:01:19.090
experience it for yourselves!

00:01:19.740 --> 00:01:25.410
<i>That's how it always starts...</i>
<i>under the azure sky</i>

00:01:25.410 --> 00:01:32.310
<i>After making a vow,</i>
<i>I now set off</i>

00:01:45.190 --> 00:01:51.700
<i>Yeah, the desertglitters with a golden hue</i>
<i>(The wind is scorching)</i>

00:01:51.700 --> 00:01:58.040
<i>I'm searching for a diamond flower</i>
<i>(I keep on wandering)</i>

00:01:58.040 --> 00:02:04.380
<i>Now, for the first time in my life,</i>

00:02:04.380 --> 00:02:10.720
<i>I live for someone else</i>

00:02:10.720 --> 00:02:17.230
<i>There's something</i>
<i>I wanna protect</i>

00:02:17.230 --> 00:02:23.230
<i>I'll never,</i>
<i>ever lose it again</i>

00:02:23.230 --> 00:02:26.740
<i>Resound,</i>
<i>my heartbeat!</i>

00:02:26.740 --> 00:02:36.730
<i>A heartbeat smaller and fragile,</i>
<i>but tougher than anyone's.</i>

00:02:49.730 --> 00:02:53.320
"Sprinting Cat"

00:02:54.090 --> 00:02:56.760
The Numbers have engaged our troops!

00:02:56.760 --> 00:02:58.600
They're headed this way!

00:03:01.370 --> 00:03:04.700
The Numbers are on their way, Creed.

00:03:04.700 --> 00:03:07.370
Creed! The Chrono Numbers are...

00:03:07.370 --> 00:03:10.040
Chrono Numbers!?

00:03:10.040 --> 00:03:14.380
Echidna, you know who I'm waiting for!

00:03:24.720 --> 00:03:27.390
Hey, are you guys all right?

00:03:27.390 --> 00:03:29.400
Where are we?

00:03:29.400 --> 00:03:30.730
Kraken Island.

00:03:30.730 --> 00:03:32.070
Where's everyone else?

00:03:32.070 --> 00:03:33.230
I don't know.

00:03:35.740 --> 00:03:37.100
What's the matter?

00:03:38.400 --> 00:03:40.410
It's nothing.

00:03:40.410 --> 00:03:43.470
It seems it's beyond this.

00:03:53.420 --> 00:03:55.750
Why you!

00:04:04.700 --> 00:04:07.370
Are you the girl from that time?

00:04:07.370 --> 00:04:08.370
Leon!

00:04:08.370 --> 00:04:11.370
I haven't had much exercise lately.

00:04:11.370 --> 00:04:13.030
I'll take you on.

00:04:18.040 --> 00:04:21.710
Hmm... Looks like I can have
a little fun with you...

00:04:21.710 --> 00:04:23.380
Promise me one thing.

00:04:23.380 --> 00:04:24.720
Huh?

00:04:24.720 --> 00:04:28.720
If I beat you, you'll leave
the Apostles of the Stars.

00:04:28.720 --> 00:04:31.720
Huh? What're you saying?

00:04:31.720 --> 00:04:35.130
Before you say such things,
worry about your own safety!

00:04:36.730 --> 00:04:39.400
No one's around...

00:04:39.400 --> 00:04:42.070
It's like a ghost town.

00:04:42.070 --> 00:04:45.000
As it is... Elly's parents
are probably also...

00:04:48.070 --> 00:04:49.440
The enemy!

00:04:52.410 --> 00:04:54.510
We have a welcoming party, huh?

00:04:55.420 --> 00:04:57.480
Well, let's do it!

00:05:02.360 --> 00:05:04.350
Small fries can stay outta here!

00:05:06.030 --> 00:05:07.520
You're...

00:05:09.360 --> 00:05:11.850
Why don't you play a bit?

00:05:13.700 --> 00:05:14.700
Dammit!

00:05:14.700 --> 00:05:17.190
You small fries are really annoying!

00:05:21.370 --> 00:05:22.810
Silphy!

00:05:38.060 --> 00:05:39.390
What the hell is this?

00:05:39.390 --> 00:05:41.830
Now, it's his turn!

00:05:46.400 --> 00:05:48.070
Another one of those?

00:05:48.070 --> 00:05:52.740
This one's different
from those half-baked samples.

00:05:52.740 --> 00:05:55.070
I wonder if you can handle him.

00:05:55.070 --> 00:05:56.410
What!?

00:05:56.410 --> 00:05:59.080
Have fun!

00:05:59.080 --> 00:06:00.910
Hold it! You won't get away!

00:06:02.010 --> 00:06:03.510
Take that!

00:06:06.020 --> 00:06:07.690
It's faster than the earlier ones!

00:06:07.690 --> 00:06:09.690
Sorry to butt in from the side!

00:06:09.690 --> 00:06:13.290
Snake... Fist!

00:06:16.030 --> 00:06:17.330
Did you get him?

00:06:22.370 --> 00:06:23.960
Bastard!

00:06:26.370 --> 00:06:28.000
Wh- what!?

00:06:29.380 --> 00:06:30.870
Fudou!

00:06:32.380 --> 00:06:33.380
Are you all right?

00:06:33.380 --> 00:06:34.750
Hmm...

00:06:36.720 --> 00:06:38.050
Mundock-<i>san</i>!

00:06:38.050 --> 00:06:39.990
You think maybe...

00:06:39.990 --> 00:06:44.390
that even someone like me made
a bit of a difference in the world?

00:06:44.390 --> 00:06:45.730
Yes!

00:06:45.730 --> 00:06:48.060
Really?

00:06:48.060 --> 00:06:50.060
That's good.

00:06:50.060 --> 00:06:52.730
Please rest a bit.

00:06:52.730 --> 00:06:54.500
I'll take over from here.

00:06:59.410 --> 00:07:02.340
Comrades? What're you saying?

00:07:02.340 --> 00:07:05.010
My only comrades are
the Apostles of the Stars!

00:07:05.010 --> 00:07:08.350
The only comrade I can trust
is the power of Tao!

00:07:08.350 --> 00:07:12.690
No, you're wrong about that.

00:07:12.690 --> 00:07:14.690
You're so bothersome.

00:07:14.690 --> 00:07:17.360
This is why I say girls are...

00:07:17.360 --> 00:07:19.690
Oops!

00:07:19.690 --> 00:07:22.360
That won't work!

00:07:22.360 --> 00:07:26.030
Eve, if you ever see Leon somewhere,

00:07:26.030 --> 00:07:29.040
there's something I'd like you
to tell him for me.

00:07:29.040 --> 00:07:35.040
"We're all waiting here for your return."
Will you tell him that?

00:07:35.040 --> 00:07:36.040
Yes...

00:07:36.040 --> 00:07:37.380
Thank you.

00:07:37.380 --> 00:07:45.050
Sure... because I'm your...
uhm... friend, Layla.

00:07:50.720 --> 00:07:51.990
Wind!?

00:07:58.060 --> 00:08:02.200
You can't defeat me
with that level of attack.

00:08:20.690 --> 00:08:22.880
You think you can hide in the water!?

00:08:26.690 --> 00:08:28.390
I see you clearly!

00:08:29.700 --> 00:08:31.220
She's so fast!

00:08:38.040 --> 00:08:40.040
What the!?

00:08:40.040 --> 00:08:41.630
Transformation?

00:09:00.660 --> 00:09:03.790
Why you!!

00:09:08.670 --> 00:09:10.000
Dammit!

00:09:10.000 --> 00:09:13.340
Why... do you fight?

00:09:13.340 --> 00:09:15.010
For my comrades in
the Apostles of the Stars!

00:09:15.010 --> 00:09:20.010
No... your comrades are not
the Apostles of the Stars!

00:09:20.010 --> 00:09:21.570
Shut up!

00:09:34.690 --> 00:09:37.720
The legs!? It can't transform its legs!?

00:09:42.030 --> 00:09:43.300
River!

00:09:51.040 --> 00:09:53.050
River, now! He can't move!

00:09:53.050 --> 00:09:55.010
Blast him!

00:09:57.720 --> 00:09:59.690
I ain't gonna give you time to transform!

00:10:07.390 --> 00:10:10.060
Geez, you've wasted our time!

00:10:10.060 --> 00:10:11.720
Hey, River!

00:10:14.070 --> 00:10:15.740
Look, River!

00:10:15.740 --> 00:10:17.070
Yeah...

00:10:17.070 --> 00:10:19.070
Looks like that was just the first one...

00:10:19.070 --> 00:10:22.070
But we know how to beat them now!

00:10:22.070 --> 00:10:25.140
I'll smash every one of 'em!

00:10:43.100 --> 00:10:45.770
Ha! Nothing but small fries...

00:10:45.770 --> 00:10:48.740
Then I'll take you on.

00:10:56.780 --> 00:11:01.380
Well, here's a staunch... no, meaty one.

00:11:01.380 --> 00:11:05.380
Sephiria, leave this ball of fat to me.

00:11:05.380 --> 00:11:06.720
Ball of...

00:11:06.720 --> 00:11:07.720
David...

00:11:07.720 --> 00:11:11.060
I can handle this meatball by myself.

00:11:11.060 --> 00:11:12.390
Meatball!?

00:11:12.390 --> 00:11:15.730
I understand. I will leave
this hunk of flesh to you.

00:11:15.730 --> 00:11:19.730
Hunk of... Hey, are you running away!?

00:11:19.730 --> 00:11:21.600
Gravity Thrust!

00:11:23.070 --> 00:11:26.410
Hold it! I said I'm your opponent!

00:11:26.410 --> 00:11:29.080
I see... then prepare to be smashed!

00:11:29.080 --> 00:11:30.940
Here!

00:11:32.080 --> 00:11:34.170
Here goes!

00:11:37.080 --> 00:11:38.080
What!?

00:11:38.080 --> 00:11:40.090
It's useless, so useless!

00:11:40.090 --> 00:11:45.420
I can manipulate gravity
to create a high-G-force area.

00:11:45.420 --> 00:11:47.760
Any projectile weapon, bullets, whatever...

00:11:47.760 --> 00:11:49.760
is useless against me!

00:11:49.760 --> 00:11:53.430
Oh, thank you kindly for that information.

00:11:53.430 --> 00:11:54.770
Die!

00:11:54.770 --> 00:11:56.790
Gravity Bomb!

00:11:57.770 --> 00:11:59.770
Damn! I'll be in trouble
if I take a direct hit.

00:11:59.770 --> 00:12:02.370
--Gravity Thrust!
--Damn!

00:12:05.380 --> 00:12:08.380
You're not much, Chrono Number!

00:12:08.380 --> 00:12:10.680
Take that! And that! And that!

00:12:14.390 --> 00:12:17.520
If my cards don't work,
I guess I have no choice...

00:12:19.060 --> 00:12:20.790
You won't get away!

00:12:22.390 --> 00:12:23.760
Darn it!

00:12:30.070 --> 00:12:32.730
Ha! You can go to hell!

00:12:36.740 --> 00:12:39.110
What!? It's huge!

00:12:40.750 --> 00:12:45.120
You or me? Who has the stronger bones?

00:12:54.760 --> 00:13:00.100
Creed... Creed is the only adult
who acknowledged me!

00:13:00.100 --> 00:13:03.600
The Apostles of the Stars
is a revolutionary group

00:13:03.600 --> 00:13:05.300
that will bring peace to this world!

00:13:08.710 --> 00:13:10.940
Your back is wide open!

00:13:16.050 --> 00:13:18.380
You can even do that!?

00:13:18.380 --> 00:13:20.820
But this time, I'm coming from here!

00:13:27.390 --> 00:13:28.830
Wha!?

00:13:30.400 --> 00:13:32.560
You can do anything, huh!?

00:13:34.730 --> 00:13:35.830
What!?

00:13:38.070 --> 00:13:42.070
H- how can I lose to
someone soft like her?

00:13:42.070 --> 00:13:44.510
Why can't I win?

00:13:46.410 --> 00:13:49.750
Why doesn't my power work against her?

00:13:49.750 --> 00:13:52.420
I risked my life to become a member
of the Apostles of the Stars...

00:13:52.420 --> 00:13:54.890
and I obtained the power!

00:14:00.360 --> 00:14:02.360
Playtime is now over.

00:14:02.360 --> 00:14:06.370
My next... my next attack
will end this battle.

00:14:06.370 --> 00:14:09.030
I'll put all of my <i>ki</i> energy into it!

00:14:10.700 --> 00:14:12.730
What the!?

00:14:16.040 --> 00:14:17.670
David!

00:14:22.720 --> 00:14:25.010
Black Cat...

00:14:26.050 --> 00:14:28.390
After all this time...

00:14:28.390 --> 00:14:31.060
you have to see me like this!

00:14:31.060 --> 00:14:35.720
But that guy looks worse than me,
doesn't he?

00:14:50.410 --> 00:14:52.750
Death Twister...

00:14:52.750 --> 00:14:55.080
I'm not gonna fool around.

00:14:55.080 --> 00:14:57.850
This is my ultimate technique!!

00:15:32.050 --> 00:15:34.050
What? Are you done already!?

00:15:34.050 --> 00:15:35.720
I have lots left in me!

00:15:35.720 --> 00:15:38.060
Hey, aren't you gonna run!?

00:15:38.060 --> 00:15:42.730
Sheesh... Don't tell me
you'll be a still target for me?

00:15:42.730 --> 00:15:47.830
--Hey! Don't take me lightly, girl!
--Transform!

00:15:54.740 --> 00:15:59.040
It's useless... even if you
turn your whole body into steel!

00:16:00.680 --> 00:16:04.680
I cannot lose! I will <i>not</i> give up!

00:16:04.680 --> 00:16:06.480
Because... I promised!

00:16:11.020 --> 00:16:14.260
Why!? Why isn't it working!?

00:16:17.030 --> 00:16:20.120
I'll crush you!!

00:16:29.380 --> 00:16:30.710
Wha!?

00:16:35.050 --> 00:16:36.380
Can't be!

00:16:43.060 --> 00:16:47.890
How... could... I have... lost?

00:16:54.070 --> 00:16:58.070
Wh- what? Why're you guys running away?

00:16:58.070 --> 00:17:01.340
We're all comrades of the
Apostles of the Stars, right?

00:17:01.340 --> 00:17:03.340
Why aren't you helping me?

00:17:03.340 --> 00:17:05.340
You lost.

00:17:05.340 --> 00:17:07.680
Not to make-believe comrades...

00:17:07.680 --> 00:17:09.350
but to your true comrades.

00:17:09.350 --> 00:17:13.690
Shut up! My only comrades
are the Apostles of the Stars.

00:17:13.690 --> 00:17:19.360
True comrades share
something stronger than power.

00:17:19.360 --> 00:17:22.030
Something stronger than power?

00:17:22.030 --> 00:17:24.720
Yes, the strength to care about others.

00:17:27.030 --> 00:17:30.370
I've lost. So kill me.

00:17:30.370 --> 00:17:34.710
My goal is not to take your life.

00:17:34.710 --> 00:17:39.140
All I want is stop you
from abusing your power.

00:17:41.710 --> 00:17:44.580
I hate grown-ups who don't make sense.

00:17:45.380 --> 00:17:49.720
Everyone died because
of unreasonable adults.

00:17:49.720 --> 00:17:53.060
They start pointless wars...

00:17:53.060 --> 00:17:56.730
without a thought for those
who are left behind.

00:17:56.730 --> 00:17:58.730
Leon...

00:17:58.730 --> 00:18:01.670
Every day was hell.

00:18:01.670 --> 00:18:04.670
It took everything just to survive.

00:18:04.670 --> 00:18:08.010
That's why I wanted power.

00:18:08.010 --> 00:18:11.010
Then I'd change this world...

00:18:11.010 --> 00:18:15.010
and create a future
for those of us left behind.

00:18:15.010 --> 00:18:19.020
I wanted a world of happiness.

00:18:19.020 --> 00:18:24.020
People are living happily,
without your doing so.

00:18:24.020 --> 00:18:27.360
You're a strange one.

00:18:27.360 --> 00:18:30.030
You're just like a girl I know.

00:18:30.030 --> 00:18:32.700
Yes, that's right...

00:18:32.700 --> 00:18:35.900
because I'm Layla's friend.

00:18:37.370 --> 00:18:39.370
I see...

00:18:39.370 --> 00:18:41.710
--Say...
--Yes?

00:18:41.710 --> 00:18:44.710
Was I... wrong?

00:18:44.710 --> 00:18:49.710
No... you just took a detour, that's all.

00:18:54.720 --> 00:18:58.060
It seems Leon has lost...

00:18:58.060 --> 00:19:00.990
What'll you do, Creed?

00:19:00.990 --> 00:19:03.660
Leon?

00:19:03.660 --> 00:19:05.790
I don't know anyone by that name.

00:19:10.000 --> 00:19:12.340
Wh- what the!?

00:19:12.340 --> 00:19:14.670
Sven!

00:19:14.670 --> 00:19:17.010
Eve! Are you all right?

00:19:17.010 --> 00:19:18.340
Uh-huh...

00:19:18.340 --> 00:19:22.680
You guys want to find Creed, right?

00:19:22.680 --> 00:19:26.690
It's useless. No one can top Creed.

00:19:26.690 --> 00:19:30.250
His... his power right now is...

00:19:38.360 --> 00:19:39.700
Are you all right, Gallom?

00:19:39.700 --> 00:19:40.700
Yeah...

00:19:40.700 --> 00:19:43.040
Gallom... how about
we do it like old times?

00:19:43.040 --> 00:19:46.040
Looks like the time has come to do it.

00:19:46.040 --> 00:19:48.040
--Let's go!
--Let's go!

00:19:48.040 --> 00:19:50.040
--You'll regret this!
--You'll regret this!

00:19:50.040 --> 00:19:52.040
--We'll fight you someday!
--We'll fight you someday!

00:19:52.040 --> 00:19:55.570
--Arghh! Dammit!
--Arghh! Dammit!

00:20:01.390 --> 00:20:04.060
Eve! Sven!

00:20:04.060 --> 00:20:06.730
Train!

00:20:06.730 --> 00:20:08.060
You all right?

00:20:08.060 --> 00:20:09.060
Yes.

00:20:09.060 --> 00:20:12.400
This is it. Stay on your gua...

00:20:12.400 --> 00:20:13.400
What's going on!?

00:20:13.400 --> 00:20:14.730
Silphy!

00:20:18.070 --> 00:20:20.770
You're... Preta Ghoul!

00:20:22.740 --> 00:20:25.740
I'll kill each and every sweeper!

00:20:25.740 --> 00:20:28.410
I'll dissolve you all one after another!

00:20:28.410 --> 00:20:30.420
And you can rot to death!

00:20:30.420 --> 00:20:33.090
That power... is also Tao Power!

00:20:33.090 --> 00:20:36.760
Train, leave him to me.

00:20:36.760 --> 00:20:39.090
You go to Creed!

00:20:39.090 --> 00:20:40.090
Sven!

00:20:40.090 --> 00:20:45.960
I'm a gentleman, and I won't stand
for anyone treating a woman this way!

00:20:52.440 --> 00:20:55.770
Well then, let's start the show, shall we!?

00:20:55.770 --> 00:20:58.210
You ought to just give up now!!

00:21:09.390 --> 00:21:13.220
Creed-<i>sama</i>! Chrono Numbers' No. I
is in the passage on the third floor!

00:21:17.730 --> 00:21:21.560
Soon... It'll soon be complete, Train!

00:21:23.400 --> 00:21:25.770
The "Song of Murderous Intent
and Friendship"

00:21:25.770 --> 00:21:27.740
which we'll perform together.

00:22:14.380 --> 00:22:21.390
<i>Since your new black boots</i>
<i>caused a blister,</i>

00:22:21.390 --> 00:22:28.400
<i>you rest your right foot</i>

00:22:28.400 --> 00:22:38.400
<i>We'll keep walking along</i>
<i>with our own rhythm, without rushing</i>

00:22:41.910 --> 00:22:51.910
<i>Don't say anything</i>
<i>because we'll soon understand each other</i>

00:22:56.460 --> 00:23:06.460
<i>I'm just holding you now to keep you warm</i>

00:23:10.710 --> 00:23:20.710
<i>I'm completely wrapped around you, so...</i>

00:23:21.120 --> 00:23:31.120
<i>Quietly the powder-like snow</i>
<i>is building up...</i>

00:23:40.540 --> 00:23:41.070
"Next Episode"

00:23:41.070 --> 00:23:43.470
<i>Train... the day has finally arrived.</i>
"Next Episode"

00:23:43.470 --> 00:23:44.410
<i>Train... the day has finally arrived.</i>

00:23:44.410 --> 00:23:50.080
<i>The memorable day you</i>
<i>and I will realize the ideal world!</i>

00:23:50.080 --> 00:23:51.750
<i>I can see...</i>

00:23:51.750 --> 00:23:55.080
<i>you running straight towards me!</i>

00:23:55.080 --> 00:23:58.750
<i>and your beautiful eyes...</i>
<i>filled with murderous intent!</i>

00:23:58.750 --> 00:24:02.490
<i>Come to me! And I will release you,</i>
<i>once and for all,</i>

00:24:02.490 --> 00:24:04.630
"Cat Faces a Showdown"
<i>from that witch's spell!</i>

00:24:04.630 --> 00:24:05.460
"Cat Faces a Showdown"
